      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "毒　　　：行動のたびにダメージを受ける\r\n暗闇　　：攻撃の命中率が低下する\r\n睡眠　　：行動不能になる。物理攻撃を受けると目覚める\r\n沈黙　　：魔法が使えなくなる\r\n麻痺　　：行動不能になる",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"bold\">Poison:</> Deals damage every time the inflicted\r\ncharacter performs an action.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Blind:</> Lowers attack hit rate.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Sleep:</> Prevents the inflicted character from taking\r\naction. The inflicted character will wake if hit with a\r\nphysical attack.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Silence:</> Prevents use of magic.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Paralysis:</> Prevents inflicted character from taking\r\naction.",
        "real_en": null
      },
