    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal:Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal_006:cf34e3c2",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal",
        "key": "Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal:Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal_006:cf34e3c2",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal:Tutorial_Battle_Abnormal_006:cf34e3c2",
        "jp_sha256": "d3a99c5fe0fd00de30cd05e56cd8b5c3b0ef72593ae754fdaa9ac86883ee2565",
        "official_en_sha256": "aa57506331f50a23938f7b7d450d5872bec58e3498859b78461c09c6fc2589c5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "石化　　：行動不能になる。全員石化状態になると全滅となる\r\n混乱　　：敵味方の見境なく攻撃する。物理攻撃を受けると治る\r\n魅了　　：ランダムに味方を攻撃する\r\nバーサク：攻撃力が上昇するが制御不能になり\r\n　　　　　勝手に攻撃する\r\n即死　　：戦闘不能になる。死の宣告を受けた場合、指定の\r\n　　　　　ターン数が経過すると、戦闘不能となる。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"bold\">Petrify:</> Prevents inflicted character from taking action. If all members are petrified, the party will fall.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Confuse:</> Inflicted character attacks enemies and allies\r\nat random. Can be cured by hitting the inflicted\r\ncharacter with a physical attack.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Charm:</> Inflicted character attacks allies at random.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Berserk:</> Increases attack power, but causes inflicted\r\ncharacter to become uncontrollable and attack at\r\nrandom.\r\n<text style=\"bold\">Instant Death:</> KO’s inflicted character. When under\r\nthe effects of Doom, the character becomes KO’d\r\nafter a certain turn count.",
        "real_en": null
      },
